{"id":"reference/WebAssembly","kind":"langref","title":"WebAssembly","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#WebAssembly","file":"reference/WebAssembly.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"WebAssembly","text":"WebAssembly"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Freestanding","text":"Freestanding"},{"depth":3,"slug":"WASI","text":"WASI"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"WebAssembly\" class=\"chapter-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/reference/WebAssembly/#WebAssembly\">WebAssembly</a> </h2>\n\n      <p>Zig supports building for WebAssembly out of the box.</p>\n      <h3 id=\"Freestanding\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/reference/WebAssembly/#Freestanding\">Freestanding</a> </h3>\n\n      <p>For host environments like the web browser and nodejs, build as an executable using the freestanding\n      OS target. Here's an example of running Zig code compiled to WebAssembly with nodejs.</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">math.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">extern</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">print</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">print</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">Terminal</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig build-exe math.zig -target wasm32-freestanding -fno-entry --export</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">add</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">test.js</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"javascript\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">fs</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">require</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">'fs'</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> fs.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">readFileSync</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"./math.wasm\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">typedArray</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">Uint8Array</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(source);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">instantiate</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(typedArray, {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">  </span></span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">env: {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">print</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">result</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=&gt;</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> { console.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">`The result is ${</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">result</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">); }</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">  </span></span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}}).</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">result</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=&gt;</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">  </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">add</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> result.instance.exports.add;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">  </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">});</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">Terminal</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ node test.js</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">The result is 3</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n      \n      <h3 id=\"WASI\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/reference/WebAssembly/#WASI\">WASI</a> </h3>\n\n      <p>Zig standard library has first-class support for WebAssembly System Interface.</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">wasi_args.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">pub</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">main</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">init</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">process</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">Init</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">!void</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">init</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">minimal</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">toSlice</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">init</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">arena</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">allocator</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">());</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.., </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">arg</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">debug</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">print</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"{d}: {s}</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, .{ </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">arg</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">Terminal</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig build-exe wasi_args.zig -target wasm32-wasi</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">Terminal</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ wasmtime wasi_args.wasm 123 hello</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">0: wasi_args.wasm</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1: 123</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">2: hello</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n      <p>A more interesting example would be extracting the list of preopens from the runtime.\n      This is now supported in the standard library via <code>std.fs.wasi.Preopens</code>:</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">wasi_preopens.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">pub</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">main</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">init</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">process</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">Init</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">init</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">preopens</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">map</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">keys</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">..) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">preopen</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">log</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">info</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"{d}: {s}\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, .{ </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">preopen</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">Terminal</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig build-exe wasi_preopens.zig -target wasm32-wasi</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">Terminal</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ wasmtime --dir</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">wasi_preopens.wasm</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">0: stdin</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1: stdout</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span 